{"id":"n48753-1-8","stage":4,"title":"돌이키다 · 转","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48753-1-8-1","ko":"음식점에 지갑을 놓고 온 것 같아.","zh":"我好像把钱包落在餐厅里了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음식점에","meaning":"餐厅，饭店","explanation":"음식점：餐厅，饭店；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"음식점","audio":"/audio/8d923a58de0234811588.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24055","senseId":"1","lemma":"음식점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식점에","audio":"/audio/7dc46c78dd7eaca52965.mp3"}},{"text":"지갑을","meaning":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","explanation":"지갑：钱包，钱夹，钱袋；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지갑","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31502","senseId":"1","lemma":"지갑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지갑을","audio":"/audio/5da093412be3fce76db0.mp3"}},{"text":"놓고","meaning":"放，放置","explanation":"놓다：放，放置；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89534","senseId":"9","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓고","audio":"/audio/4d87d21ee2c596006dc8.mp3"}},{"text":"온","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"온","audio":"/audio/dcc56310451956332238.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8d923a58de023481","term":"음식점","zh":"餐厅，饭店","audio":"/audio/8d923a58de0234811588.mp3","entryId":"24055","definition":"制作出售食物的店铺。","pronunciation":["음ː식쩜"]},{"id":"523a0f1558bc4c4d","term":"지갑","zh":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3","entryId":"31502","definition":"为便于携带钱、卡、名片等物品，用皮或布料制作的小包。","pronunciation":["지갑"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"放，放置","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"89534","definition":"把原本手里抓或握着的物体置于某处。","pronunciation":["노타"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8958ed9a132214b8ebf7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48753-1-8-2","ko":"빨리 차를 돌이켜서 다시 음식점으로 가자.","zh":"快把车掉头，再回到餐厅去吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}},{"text":"차를","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차를","audio":"/audio/c9101b9a3fcbc9e75de1.mp3"}},{"te